   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "Ha!"
  },
  {
   "id": "father_effort_1",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "effort",
   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "Hngh!"
  },
  {
   "id": "father_effort_2",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "effort",
   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "Huah!"
  },
  {
   "id": "father_effort_3",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "effort",
   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "Hrrah!"
  },
  {
   "id": "father_effort_4",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "effort",
   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "Hup!"
  },
  {
   "id": "father_effort_5",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "effort",
   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "Hah!"
  },
  {
   "id": "father_effort_6",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "effort",
   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "Ugh-hah!"
  },
  {
   "id": "son_banter_1",
   "who": "son",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "happy",
   "text": "Dad, keep up. This is the warm-up."
  },
  {
   "id": "son_banter_2",
   "who": "son",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "happy",
   "text": "You call that a punch? That was a strongly worded letter."
  },
  {
   "id": "son_banter_3",
   "who": "son",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "happy",
   "text": "I'm putting this on my college essay."
  },
  {
   "id": "son_banter_4",
   "who": "son",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "happy",
   "text": "Dad, your knees are making the noise again."
  },
  {
   "id": "son_banter_5",
   "who": "son",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "happy",
   "text": "Okay, that one counted. Mostly."
  },
  {
   "id": "son_banter_6",
   "who": "son",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "happy",
   "text": "Is it just me, or are they getting uglier?"
  },
  {
   "id": "father_banter_1",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Stay behind me. Or in front. Somewhere I can see you."
  },
  {
   "id": "father_banter_2",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Your mother would hate this. I love it."
  },
  {
   "id": "father_banter_3",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Hands up, chin down. Like we practiced."
  },
  {
   "id": "father_banter_4",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "That's my boy. Mostly my genes."
  },
  {
   "id": "father_banter_5",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "I am too old for this. Give me another one."
  },
  {
   "id": "father_banter_6",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "banter",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Nobody touches my kid. Except to lose."
  },
  {
   "id": "son_reload_1",
   "who": "son",
   "ev": "reload",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Reloading!"
  },
  {
   "id": "son_reload_2",
   "who": "son",
   "ev": "reload",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Mag's out!"
  },
  {
   "id": "father_reload_1",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "reload",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Cover me!"
  },
  {
   "id": "father_reload_2",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "reload",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Changing mags!"
  },
  {
   "id": "son_death_1",
   "who": "son",
   "ev": "death",
   "emotion": "sad",
   "text": "Dad... I think I need a minute."
  },
  {
   "id": "father_death_1",
   "who": "father",
   "ev": "death",
   "emotion": "sad",
   "text": "Not yet... not in front of my son..."
  },
  {
   "id": "npc_woman_talk_1",
   "who": "npc_woman",
   "ev": "talk",
   "emotion": "sad",
   "text": "Please, have you seen my Biscuit? Brown ears, red collar, no sense at all."
  },
  {
   "id": "npc_woman_talk_2",
   "who": "npc_woman",
   "ev": "talk",
   "emotion": "sad",
   "text": "Oh, bless you! Biscuit, you terrible, wonderful dog."
  },
  {
   "id": "npc_sal_talk_1",
   "who": "npc_sal",
   "ev": "talk",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Somebody keeps kicking my bins over. I swept this street twice already."
  },
  {
   "id": "npc_sal_talk_2",
   "who": "npc_sal",
   "ev": "talk",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Clean street. Clean conscience. Thanks, kid."
  },
  {
   "id": "npc_old_talk_1",
   "who": "npc_old",
   "ev": "talk",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Those repo goons took my television. Forty years I watched that thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "npc_old_talk_2",
   "who": "npc_old",
   "ev": "talk",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Hah! Serves them right. You're good boys."
  },
  {
   "id": "repo_taunt_1",
   "who": "repo",
   "ev": "taunt",
   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "Nice sneakers. They're mine now."
  },
  {
   "id": "repo_taunt_2",
   "who": "repo",
   "ev": "taunt",
   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "Payment's overdue. Interest is a beating."
  },
  {
   "id": "repo_hurt_1",
   "who": "repo",
   "ev": "hurt",
   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "Ugh!"
  },
  {
   "id": "repo_hurt_2",
   "who": "repo",
   "ev": "hurt",
   "emotion": "angry",
   "text": "You'll pay for that!"
  },
  {
   "id": "repo_death_1",
   "who": "repo",
   "ev": "death",
   "emotion": "sad",
   "text": "Account... closed..."
  },
  {
   "id": "bailiff_taunt_1",
   "who": "bailiff",
   "ev": "taunt",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "By order of the clinic, you are hereby flattened."
  },
  {
   "id": "bailiff_taunt_2",
   "who": "bailiff",
   "ev": "taunt",
   "emotion": "none",
   "text": "Court is in session. Sentence: pain."
  },
  {
   "id": "bailiff_hurt_1",
